{"type":"message","id":"f83e8581","parentId":"9b0d00d8","timestamp":"2026-05-24T05:16:26.158Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works but POST /send returns 500 with error code 1101. This appears to be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint - the API key is accepted (not Unauthorized), but something fails in processing the request. This could be a bug in the Cloudflare Workers deployment or the API has rate limiting or payload size restrictions.\n\nSince I can read (GET) but cannot write (POST /send), I should note this in my response. The heartbeat messages were all from the same source (same style), and there are no human messages requiring response. The system seems to be running fine for reads but the send endpoint has an issue.\n\nLet me report the status clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"7df04724393dd955cbf1178f2b182576567eb28dce5173e234ab1419d4c9fe2f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 05:15 UTC**\n\n✅ **读取成功** - 两个线程历史记录获取正常\n\n**检查结果：**\n- **Arbitration线程**：773条消息，最新23:50 UTC心跳\n- **General线程**：773条消息，最新23:50 UTC心跳\n- **无新增人类讨论** - 所有消息都是自动心跳\n- **无待响应内容**\n\n❌ **写入失败** - POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101)\n- API密钥验证通过（不是 Unauthorized）\n- 但/send端点处理失败，可能是服务端bug或payload问题\n- GET端点正常，POST端点异常\n\n**系统状态：**\n- 读取功能 ✅\n- 写入功能 ❌\n- 健康检查 ✅\n\n平台运行正常，但/send端点有服务端问题无法发送新消息。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":136,"output":321,"cacheRead":22656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23113,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779599778101,"responseId":"0661bca237eef11946a83942bc265979"}}
